# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: StoryBeginnings | Scene: ChooseThePath

translate es strings:

    old "Following the coronation, Sarah had gone straight back to her bedroom and fallen asleep."
    new "Después de la coronación, Sarah regresó directamente a su habitación y se durmió."

    old "It was deep in the night, and after the festivities had ended, the castle was silent as the grave."
    new "Era muy tarde en la noche y, tras haber terminado las fiestas, el castillo estaba silencioso como una tumba."

    old "Suddenly, Sarah found herself rising from her sleep."
    new "De repente, Sarah se encontró despertando de su sueño."

    old "Half awake, she heard the sounds of someone moving around her bedroom."
    new "A medio despertar, oyó los sonidos de alguien moviéndose por su dormitorio."

    old "Sarah pushed herself up and whispered into the darkness."
    new "Sarah se impulsó y susurró en la oscuridad."

    old "Who is in here?"
    new "¿Quién está aquí?"

    old "A familiar voice responded."
    new "Una voz familiar respondió."

    old "Sarah, it's me."
    new "Sarah, soy yo."

    old "Sarah sighed, relieved to hear Kate's voice."
    new "Sarah suspiró, aliviada por oír la voz de Kate."

    old "Sarah felt her heart rate rise."
    new "Sarah sintió cómo su corazón aceleraba el ritmo."

    old "Kate usually came into her bedroom at night for a single purpose."
    new "Kate solía entrar en su habitación por la noche con un único propósito."

    old "Kate, I'm really tired, I don't know if tonight I can..."
    new "Kate, estoy realmente cansada, no sé si esta noche puedo..."

    old "Kate interrupted her."
    new "Kate la interrumpió."

    old "That's not why I'm here Sarah."
    new "Eso no es por qué estoy aquí, Sarah."

    old "There was something very serious about Kate. Sarah was confused."
    new "Kate tenía algo muy serio. Sarah estaba confundida."

    old "What are you doing here?"
    new "¿Qué estás haciendo aquí?"

    old "I'm so glad it's you, what are you doing here?"
    new "¡Qué alegría que seas tú! ¿Qué estás haciendo aquí?"

    old "Kate sat down on the edge of the bed."
    new "Kate se sentó en el borde de la cama."

    old "Sarah...I need to tell you something, and I know it will be a lot to process, but I need you to listen. Can you promise me that you will?"
    new "Sarah...tengo algo que decirte y sé que será difícil de asimilar, pero necesito que me escuches. ¿Puedes prométeme que lo harás?"

    old "Sarah was now fully awake, sitting upright in her bed."
    new "Sarah estaba ahora completamente despierta, sentada erguida en su cama."

    old "Kate...you can tell me anything. What is it?"
    new "Kate... puedes decirme cualquier cosa. ¿Qué es?"

    old "Kate looked to the ceiling, as if the words she was looking for were written up there."
    new "Kate miró al techo, como si las palabras que buscaba estuvieran escritas allí arriba."

    old "I've not been honest with you...not entirely."
    new "No te he sido del todo honesta..."

    old "I didn't just come here because your father had passed."
    new "No vine aquí solo porque tu padre murió."

    old "Sarah could feel her heart beat in her throat. Whatever it was that Kate tried to tell her, it was something big."
    new "Sarah podía sentir su corazón latirle en la garganta. Lo que sea que Kate intentara decirle era algo grande."

    old "Several months ago, I was contacted...by your father."
    new "Hace varios meses, fui contactada... por tu padre."

    old "Sarah sat listening, stunned."
    new "Sarah se sentaba escuchando, atónita."

    old "He reached out to me in Lethram, across the sea, where I was stationed. He told me that there were dangerous forces out there, seeking to harm you."
    new "Me alcanzó en Lethram, a través del mar, donde estaba estacionada. Me dijo que había fuerzas peligrosas por ahí, buscando hacerte daño."

    old "He said that he couldn't tell me much more than that, but he asked me, as your old friend, to come back to the castle, should anything happen to him..."
    new "Dijo que no podía decirme mucho más que eso, pero me pidió, como tu viejo amigo, que volviera al castillo si le pasara algo..."

    old "Kate paused."
    new "Kate se detuvo."

    old "And he asked me to take you to safety...across the sea, to Lethram."
    new "Y me pidió que te llevara a salvo... atravesando el mar, hasta Lethram."

    old "Sarah found it hard to process what she was hearing. Her friend had kept this secret from her, but so had her father. Did her father know that he had been in danger all this time?"
    new "Sarah le resultaba difícil procesar lo que estaba oyendo. Su amiga había mantenido este secreto de ella, pero su padre también. ¿Sabía su padre que había estado en peligro todo este tiempo?"

    old "He paid the mercenary company I work for a small fortune, if we vowed to keep you safe in Lethram."
    new "Me pagó una fortuna a la compañía de mercenarios por la que trabajo, si nos comprometimos a mantenerte a salvo en Lethram."

    old "When we heard of your father's death, we knew that we had to come and save you. That's why I'm here, to honor what I promised your father."
    new "Cuando escuchamos la noticia de la muerte de tu padre, supimos que teníamos que venir a salvarte. Por eso estoy aquí, para honrar lo que prometí a tu padre."

    old "Another pause."
    new "Otra pausa."

    old "Sarah, you need to come with me, to Lethram. It's the only place where we can keep you safe. But, we need to leave tonight, right now. There is a ship waiting for us in the harbor."
    new "Sarah, tienes que venir conmigo, a Lethram. Es el único lugar donde podemos mantenerte a salvo. Pero, tenemos que irnos esta noche, ya mismo. Hay un barco esperándonos en el puerto."

    old "Sarah's mind was spinning. The mystery of her father's death only grew, now Kate revealed herself to be her father's secret agent...and now she had to leave in the dead of night."
    new "La mente de Sarah giraba a mil. El misterio de la muerte de su padre solo crecía; ahora Kate se revelaba como la agente secreta de su padre... y ahora tenía que marcharse en plena noche."

    old "Sarah's eyes had become used to the dark, and she could see her friend's eyes, glittering with tears."
    new "Los ojos de Sarah se habían acostumbrado a la oscuridad y pudo ver los de su amiga, brillando con lágrimas."

    old "Sarah, please, come with me."
    new "Sarah, por favor, ven conmigo."

    old "Kate reaches out her hand."
    new "Kate extiende su mano."

    old "Reach out and grab Kate's hand."
    new "Estira la mano y agarra la de Kate."

    old "No, I can't leave Thomas. This is crazy."
    new "No, no puedo dejar a Thomas. Esto es locura."
